 796:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** /** @defgroup USART_Group5 Halfduplex mode function
 797:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****  *  @brief   Half-duplex mode function 
 798:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****  *
 799:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** @verbatim   
 800:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****  ===============================================================================
 801:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****                     ##### Half-duplex mode function #####
 802:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 803:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     [..]
 804:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to manage the USART 
 805:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     Half-duplex communication.
 806:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     [..]
 807:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     The USART can be configured to follow a single-wire half-duplex protocol where 
 808:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     the TX and RX lines are internally connected.
 809:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     [..]
 810:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     USART Half duplex communication is possible through the following procedure:
 811:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (#) Program the Baud rate, Word length, Stop bits, Parity, Mode transmitter 
 812:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****           or Mode receiver and hardware flow control values using the USART_Init()
 813:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****           function.
 814:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (#) Configures the USART address using the USART_SetAddress() function.
 815:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (#) Enable the USART using the USART_Cmd() function.
 816:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (#) Enable the half duplex mode using USART_HalfDuplexCmd() function.
 817:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** 
 818:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** 
 819:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     -@- The RX pin is no longer used
 820:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****     -@- In Half-duplex mode the following bits must be kept cleared:
 821:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (+@) LINEN and CLKEN bits in the USART_CR2 register.
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccdQ2tkR.s 			page 34


 822:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****       (+@) SCEN and IREN bits in the USART_CR3 register.
 823:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** 
 824:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** @endverbatim
 825:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @{
 826:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   */
 827:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** 
