1426:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c **** /**
1427:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @brief  Clears the USARTx's interrupt pending bits.
1428:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @param  USARTx: where x can be 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 or 8 to select the USART or 
1429:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *         UART peripheral.
1430:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @param  USART_IT: specifies the interrupt pending bit to clear.
1431:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1432:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *            @arg USART_IT_CTS:  CTS change interrupt (not available for UART4 and UART5)
1433:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *            @arg USART_IT_LBD:  LIN Break detection interrupt
1434:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *            @arg USART_IT_TC:   Transmission complete interrupt. 
1435:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *            @arg USART_IT_RXNE: Receive Data register not empty interrupt.
1436:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *
1437:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @note   PE (Parity error), FE (Framing error), NE (Noise error), ORE (OverRun 
1438:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          error) and IDLE (Idle line detected) pending bits are cleared by 
1439:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          software sequence: a read operation to USART_SR register 
1440:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          (USART_GetITStatus()) followed by a read operation to USART_DR register 
1441:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          (USART_ReceiveData()).
1442:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @note   RXNE pending bit can be also cleared by a read to the USART_DR register 
1443:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          (USART_ReceiveData()).
1444:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @note   TC pending bit can be also cleared by software sequence: a read 
1445:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          operation to USART_SR register (USART_GetITStatus()) followed by a write 
1446:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          operation to USART_DR register (USART_SendData()).
1447:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   * @note   TXE pending bit is cleared only by a write to the USART_DR register 
1448:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *          (USART_SendData()).
1449:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_usart.c ****   *  
